<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 332 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 332 mln pesos.</headline>
<text>
<p>MEXICO CITY, Jan 24 - Banco de Mexico assigned one single auction whereby it sought to drain 332 million pesos from the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    332 million    3 days  22.75 pct</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
